    "text": "We draw the posters with Gemini 3 Pro Image. It composes a good scene, with rich colour, light behind the pack and a clear layout. The text lets it down. Google's documentation for the model lists the languages it handles best, and Gujarati is missing from that list. The same page suggests generating the text on its own."
